  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;det till FN:s fond f&#xf6;r katastrofbist&#xe5;nd (CERF) 2026-2028 bidrar till att uppn&#xe5; Sveriges m&#xe5;l f&#xf6;r det humanit&#xe4;ra bist&#xe5;ndet om att r&#xe4;dda liv och lindra n&#xf6;d genom att snabbt m&#xf6;ta akuta humanit&#xe4;ra behov.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The core support to the Central Emergency Response Fund (CERF) 2026-2028 contributes to achieving Sweden&apos;s humanitarian assistance goals of saving lives and alleviating suffering by rapidly addressing urgent humanitarian needs.</narrative>
